    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sequel to the original 2016 game. A simple meditative platformer with nice graphics and a pleasant soundtrack. New levels and new biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go through levels filled with unique traps for each biome. Collect as many points and Collection items as possible. The game is made in the best traditions of the much-loved\u00a0 original. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique and manually  created levels, where there are several paths to the finish, and only you can decide which path to choose: dangerous, but with a good reward, or safe, but with a lesser reward. Unique traps  for each biome.</p>",
